29	\caption{Causal DAG of the self-extraction pipeline. Traces $T$ produce both answers $A$ and constraints $C$; under degeneration (Observation~1), $C$ is determined by $A$ (dashed arrow), yielding $I(C;Y) \leq I(A;Y)$.}
